{"file": "tori.trades_118_321997v_DBWF289Jczi.mp4", "language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.44, "text": "Swear to God, I've walked into two Rolex dealers with this on", "words": [{"w": "Swear", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.3}, {"w": "to", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.4}, {"w": "God,", "start": 0.4, "end": 0.74}, {"w": "I've", "start": 0.92, "end": 1.04}, {"w": "walked", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.24}, {"w": "into", "start": 1.24, "end": 1.44}, {"w": "two", "start": 1.44, "end": 1.84}, {"w": "Rolex", "start": 1.84, "end": 2.28}, {"w": "dealers", "start": 2.28, "end": 2.72}, {"w": "with", "start": 2.72, "end": 3.06}, {"w": "this", "start": 3.06, "end": 3.22}, {"w": "on", "start": 3.22, "end": 3.44}]}, {"start": 3.44, "end": 5.46, "text": "and they say, oh, we just so happen to have some watches", "words": [{"w": "and", "start": 3.44, "end": 3.62}, {"w": "they", "start": 3.62, "end": 3.74}, {"w": "say,", "start": 3.74, "end": 3.82}, {"w": "oh,", "start": 3.88, "end": 4.02}, {"w": "we", "start": 4.04, "end": 4.14}, {"w": "just", "start": 4.14, "end": 4.3}, {"w": "so", "start": 4.3, "end": 4.48}, {"w": "happen", "start": 4.48, "end": 4.72}, {"w": "to", "start": 4.72, "end": 4.92}, {"w": "have", "start": 4.92, "end": 5.02}, {"w": "some", "start": 5.02, "end": 5.2}, {"w": "watches", "start": 5.2, "end": 5.46}]}, {"start": 5.46, "end": 6.18, "text": "available now.", "words": [{"w": "available", "start": 5.46, "end": 5.8}, {"w": "now.", "start": 5.8, "end": 6.18}]}, {"start": 6.32, "end": 8.38, "text": "This watch costs me $200,000.", "words": [{"w": "This", "start": 6.32, "end": 6.4}, {"w": "watch", "start": 6.4, "end": 6.74}, {"w": "costs", "start": 6.74, "end": 7.16}, {"w": "me", "start": 7.16, "end": 7.48}, {"w": "$200", "start": 7.48, "end": 7.98}, {"w": ",000.", "start": 7.98, "end": 8.38}]}, {"start": 8.72, "end": 10.12, "text": "When you walk around with this watch on,", "words": [{"w": "When", "start": 8.72, "end": 8.82}, {"w": "you", "start": 8.82, "end": 8.88}, {